# C++ Data Preprocessing Code with Detailed Comments

Here's the complete C++ implementation with detailed comments for each function to facilitate maintenance and understanding:

```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <fstream>
#include <vector>
#include <string>
#include <regex>
#include <algorithm>
#include <unordered_map>
#include <sstream>
#include <iomanip>
